    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. you mentioned the \"high risks\" and the lack of a post-conflict plan. do you think the whole thing was just a mistake from the start, or was it actually a moral necessity because of what was happening with Qaddafi? like, was there even a \"right\" way to do it, or should the US have just stayed out entirely?",
