      "content": "so r u saying the moral part was the \"correct\" part and only the planning was wrong? it feels like u almost favor the idea that we had to step in regardless of the outcome. some people would say that intervening at all was just an excuse for regime change and that the 'moral necessity' argument is just something used to justify messy politics. do u think that's a fair critique?",
